(12, 'ACID Properties in Relational Databases', 'What does the Isolation property in ACID guarantee? (A) Data is written to disk (B) Transactions do not interfere with each other (C) Foreign keys are valid (D) All changes are committed or none', 'Easy', 'mcq', NOW(), NOW()),
(12, 'Deadlock Coffman Conditions', 'Which of the following is NOT one of the 4 necessary conditions for deadlock? (A) Mutual Exclusion (B) Hold and Wait (C) Preemption allowed (D) Circular Wait', 'Easy', 'mcq', NOW(), NOW()),
