(12, 'Virtual Memory and Page Faults', 'What causes a Page Fault in an operating system? (A) Page table corruption (B) Accessing a page not present in physical RAM (C) Stack overflow (D) Memory leak', 'Easy', 'mcq', NOW(), NOW()),
(12, 'OSI Model Layer for Routers', 'At which layer of the OSI model do network routers primarily operate? (A) Data Link Layer (B) Transport Layer (C) Network Layer (D) Session Layer', 'Easy', 'mcq', NOW(), NOW()),
(12, 'Database Normalization 2NF Rule', 'A table is in Second Normal Form (2NF) if it is in 1NF and: (A) Has no transitive dependencies (B) Has no partial dependencies on a composite primary key (C) Contains multi-valued attributes (D) Uses B-Trees', 'Easy', 'mcq', NOW(), NOW()),
(12, 'OOPs Polymorphism Concept', 'Method Overloading is an example of which type of polymorphism? (A) Compile-time (Static) (B) Run-time (Dynamic) (C) Parametric (D) Subtyping', 'Easy', 'mcq', NOW(), NOW()),
(12, 'Context Switching Overhead', 'What is saved in the Process Control Block (PCB) during a CPU context switch? (A) File cache only (B) Program counter, registers, and memory pointers (C) Hard drive sectors (D) Network socket buffers', 'Easy', 'mcq', NOW(), NOW()),
(12, 'DNS Protocol Default Port & Transport', 'Which port and transport protocol are primarily used for standard DNS lookups? (A) Port 53 / UDP (B) Port 80 / TCP (C) Port 443 / UDP (D) Port 25 / TCP', 'Easy', 'mcq', NOW(), NOW()),
(12, 'Time Complexity of Binary Search', 'What is the worst-case time complexity of binary search on a sorted array of size n? (A) O(1) (B) O(log n) (C) O(n) (D) O(n log n)', 'Easy', 'mcq', NOW(), NOW()),
(12, 'B-Tree vs Binary Search Tree in Databases', 'Why do relational databases use B+ Trees over BSTs for on-disk indexes? (A) B+ Trees use less memory (B) High fanout minimizes disk I/O seek operations (C) BSTs cannot store numbers (D) B+ Trees avoid sorting', 'Medium', 'mcq', NOW(), NOW()),
(12, 'Difference Between Mutex and Semaphore', 'What distinguishes a binary semaphore from a mutex? (A) A mutex has an ownership concept; only the locking thread can unlock it (B) Semaphores are faster (C) Mutex allows count > 1 (D) Semaphores only work on Linux', 'Medium', 'mcq', NOW(), NOW()),
(12, 'TCP vs UDP Characteristics', 'Which statement is true regarding UDP? (A) Connection-oriented and ordered (B) Connectionless with no delivery guarantee or flow control (C) Implements congestion control (D) Slower than TCP', 'Easy', 'mcq', NOW(), NOW()),
(12, 'Memory Allocation: Stack vs Heap', 'Which memory area is automatically reclaimed when a function execution terminates? (A) Heap (B) Stack (C) Static data segment (D) BSS segment', 'Easy', 'mcq', NOW(), NOW()),
(12, 'Database Transaction Isolation: Dirty Read', 'What is a Dirty Read in database transactions? (A) Reading data that has been modified by an uncommitted transaction (B) Reading same row twice with different values (C) Phantom rows appearing (D) Reading corrupt disk blocks', 'Medium', 'mcq', NOW(), NOW()),
(12, 'Garbage Collection Mark-and-Sweep', 'What occurs during the Mark phase of Mark-and-Sweep GC? (A) Unreachable objects are freed (B) Reachable objects from GC roots are traversed and flagged (C) Memory is compacted (D) CPU stops permanently', 'Medium', 'mcq', NOW(), NOW()),
